[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Restore previous look (Safeer Cinnamon off)
Name[sl]=Vrni prejšnji videz (Safeer Cinnamon izklopi)
Comment=Puts back the theme, panel, dock and wallpaper you had before Safeer Cinnamon
Comment[sl]=Vrne temo, pult, dock in ozadje, kot so bili pred Safeer Cinnamon
Exec=safeer-cinnamon --izklopi
